      "html": "\n    <div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 650px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\">\n      <div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #072439, #094732); color: #ffffff; padding: 28px 32px; text-align: left;\">\n        <div style=\"display: inline-block; background: #08b48f; color: #072439; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n          Admissions & Governance\n        </div>\n        <h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff;\">Kellem Secondary School</h1>\n        <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #a9d8c2;\">Mana Barumsaa Qellem Sad 2ffaa • Dambi Dollo, Ethiopia</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"padding: 32px; color: #1e293b; line-height: 1.6;\">\n        <div style=\"background: #fffbeb; border: 1px solid #fde68a; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 14px 18px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n          <strong style=\"color: #92400e; font-size: 15px;\">Pending Student Registration Request</strong>\n          <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0; color: #b45309; font-size: 13px;\">A new student has registered and requires administrator approval before they can access protected curriculum pages, Kellem AI, or practice quizzes.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 17px; color: #0f172a; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 8px;\">Applicant Details</h3>\n        <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 8px 0; color: #64748b; width: 140px; font-weight: 600;\">Student Name:</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 8px 0; color: #0f17